-- _numstr: (raw -- bytes).  pico8's tostr: the integer part, then up to 4 decimals.
-- REVIEW: Decimals round to the nearest 1/10000. Alternative: truncate. It needs checking against pico8 itself.
('nr let nr 0 lt (0 nr sub) (nr) if 'na let
